{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id105085134"}, "name":{"label":"Liam Bardwell"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-04T08:55:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.18.1"}, "id":{"label":"12503094160"}, "title":{"label":"It is Couple Joy"}, "content":{"label":"So I recently downloaded this app and sent it to my Husband. I saw it on social media and thought let’s give it a go. \nThe free version is great and found out a lot about each other after 16 years. So we have purchased the full version. We were hesitant to do this as thought will it be for straight couples but the questions are very open and are for any couples. It is a very diverse app. I’m looking forward to explore more to see what adventure this app takes us on.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
