{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1467069535"}, "name":{"label":"Majkel_D_Cember"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-03T07:19:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.17.0"}, "id":{"label":"12377532717"}, "title":{"label":"Must-have app for any couple! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}, "content":{"label":"CoupleJoy has been an absolute game-changer for my relationship! The daily questions are such a fun and meaningful way to connect, and the quizzes keep things fresh with new ones popping up all the time. It’s amazing how much closer we feel just by using the app regularly.\n\nThe premium features are a great addition, especially the widgets—they make everything even more engaging. While the free version is already fantastic, the premium upgrade really enhances the experience without feeling like a necessity.\n\nWhat truly sets CoupleJoy apart, though, is the outstanding customer service. They are incredibly responsive, take user feedback seriously, and genuinely go above and beyond to help. You can tell they care about their users, and their quick support makes a real difference.\n\nIf you’re in a relationship, this app is a must-try!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
