{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1611042702"}, "name":{"label":"Mr adir"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-29T05:54:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.16.0"}, "id":{"label":"12244981000"}, "title":{"label":"Banake"}, "content":{"label":"It’s actually help with my relationship , I have a long distance relationship and sometimes I don’t know what to ask or what to do and this app gave me a lot of ideas and it was fun.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id504571152"}, "name":{"label":"Jessie564"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-29T05:47:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.16.0"}, "id":{"label":"12244956054"}, "title":{"label":"Brings you closer to your partner"}, "content":{"label":"My boyfriend suggested to download this app to me a few months back, after he saw it advertised on TikTok. I thought it was sweet he wanted to try it, so we downloaded and looked through it together. I like that you have the option to add personalised icons to your Home/lock Screen, which says how many days you’ve been together etc, it is a really sweet feature and lets me know exactly how many days until the next anniversary. I also like that every day we both get a notification of a question to answer for that day and we answer it as honestly as possible. I have found it helps my boyfriend and me, be more open about things that we feel and activities we feel we should do more of together. Sometimes it’s even silly things like our favourite picture together, or something silly we believed in as a child. It helps you get to know your partner in a better way, as the questions asked are good prompts as some of them I’ve never thought of even asking. I rate this app 5 stars due to the fact no app has made me continuously open it every day, unlike this one. I can’t wait to see his responses, and he can’t wait to see mine :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
